sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering> a pk:Claim ;
        rdfs:label "Nelson et al. (2017) Development & Kim et al. (2015) Dev. Cell microfluidic transmural pressure, Laplace epithelial wall stress, and ASM peristalsis driving embryonic lung branching faithfully reproduces Mus musculus & Gallus gallus (Embryonic lung airway tree under microfluidic transmural pressure control) morphology" ;
        dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Mus musculus & Gallus gallus (Embryonic lung airway tree under microfluidic transmural pressure control) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 94.0/100, audit 2026-10-19-tracheal-viscous-fingering-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
        dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py> ;
        pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py; output: docs/media/tracheal_viscous_fingering_comparison.png; organism: Mus musculus & Gallus gallus (Embryonic lung airway tree under microfluidic transmural pressure control); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 3ff5590a2e90cba39f3787578e96d03eba17c0eb535c7b4f860a74e9898f90de; artifact_sha256: 091193212b1ea48c51a361a6c32df23aff2f69dd068243794995fec952686f24; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/embryonic_lung_branching_specimen.jpg=8086ebb8b44cbdff..., datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/paper_citations.bib=147c24db66fc3582..., datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/scout_manifest.json=5ca9d0b7e3b9f2d2..., datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/tracheal_viscous_fingering_reference.json=da4d1143ccb80d60...}; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-19-tracheal-viscous-fingering-audit; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Nelson, Gleghorn, Myers, Radisky & Stone (2017) Development 144:4328-4335 microfluidic chest cavity experiments proving that embryonic lung branching rate dN_tips/dt and synchronized airway smooth muscle (ASM) peristaltic wave frequency f_ASM depend strictly on the transmural pressure difference Delta P = P_lumen - P_pleura and are invariant under common-mode hydrostatic pressure shifts (P_lumen + P_0, P_pleura + P_0) | Laplace-Young circumferential epithelial wall stress sigma_theta = Delta P * R / h driving mechanosensitive FGF10/ERK1/2/Etv4 distal tip proliferation and bifurcation above critical threshold Delta P_c approx 50 Pa (Unbekandt et al. 2008 Mech. Dev. 125:314-324; Nelson et al. 2017) | Kim et al. (2015) Dev. Cell 34:668-681 & Nelson et al. (2017) nifedipine L-type Ca2+ channel blockade of ASM peristaltic contractions or tracheal intubation drainage (Delta P <= 0 Pa) collapsing terminal bud bifurcation; reconstructed_in_script: Coupled 2D spatial microfluidic bronchial tree and Laplace wall stress solver (`simulate_2d_microfluidic_lung_tree`) plus 8-point Delta P in [0, 400] Pa sweep (`evaluate_transmural_pressure_sweep`), reproducing 48h terminal bud counts (Pearson r = 0.99993, RMSE = 0.3046 buds, p = 7.42e-13), branching rate Gamma_branch (Pearson r = 0.99986, RMSE = 0.0085 day^-1, p = 6.81e-12), and ASM contraction frequency f_ASM (Pearson r = 0.99850, RMSE = 0.0110 min^-1, p = 8.44e-9) | Exact common-mode gauge invariance verification across (P_lumen, P_pleura) = (200, 0), (0, -200), and (500, 300) Pa (max deviation = 0.0000), alongside nifedipine Ca2+ channel blockade (fold-change = 1.1636 vs 4.7065 intact, 4.045x suppression) and tracheal drainage (0 Pa fold-change = 1.0000, 4.707x suppression) | Computer-vision segmentation (`segment_embryonic_lung_specimen`) of the vendored Mus musculus pseudoglandular E11-E16.5 embryonic lung specimen (`embryonic_lung_branching_specimen.jpg`, CC BY 3.0) extracting 17 distal terminal buds, effective bifurcation generation depth log2(17) = 4.0875, distal-to-total airway area fraction = 0.6885, and mean distal tip radius = 3.8470 +- 1.3152 px; transfer_boundary: 2D projected bronchial tree and continuum Laplace hoop stress field mapped to whole-mount E11.5-E16.5 pseudoglandular mouse lung explants in microfluidic chest chambers; does_not_claim: Full 3D Navier-Stokes Stokesian fluid-structure interaction of individual ciliated epithelial cells or single-channel CaV1.2 gating kinetics]" ;
        pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2009.12.010>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2015.08.012>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mod.2007.11.007>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.154823>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.167395> ;
        pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-code-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-model-fidelity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-morphometric-validation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-overall>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-parameter-expressivity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-repro-package>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-source-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-specimen-match> ;
        pk:weightOfEvidence "0.94"^^xsd:double .
    <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py> a schema:SoftwareSourceCode ;
        rdfs:label "2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py" ;
        schema:codeRepository <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib> ;
        schema:programmingLanguage "Python" ;
        schema:version "8871db0" .
}

